{"seq":2,"slug":"stacking-orientation-nesting-fillrate","title":"堆码/朝向/嵌套与体积利用率","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/packaging-loading-optimization/cartonization-algorithm/stacking-orientation-nesting-fillrate","wordCount":2158,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"堆码-朝向-嵌套与体积利用率\">堆码/朝向/嵌套与体积利用率</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>选好了箱，下一个问题是怎么在箱里摆。摆放的自由度来自三处：<strong>朝向</strong>（每件商品能在几个方向上放）、<strong>堆叠</strong>（能不能叠、叠几层）、<strong>嵌套</strong>（能否插进彼此的凹位）。这三者共同决定了能不能把箱内体积真正用起来，也决定了体积利用率这个指标到底能爬多高。</p>\n<p>体积利用率（fill rate）的定义必须先钉死，否则数据毫无可比性。本文统一使用<strong>净空间利用率</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_{net} = \\frac{\\sum_i v_i}{V_{usable}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2757em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4397em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ab</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6897em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是商品实际占用的包围盒体积，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{usable}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ab</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是箱的净可用容积（内径乘积，见 <a href=\"../dimension-packaging-masterdata/packaging-material-library-selection\">包材库与选型</a>）。用外径做分母会把纸板厚度算成&quot;浪费&quot;，把所有箱型的利用率系统性压低几个百分点，是常见的口径错误。</p>\n<p>顺带明确一层概念边界：本节的摆放问题与&quot;装箱问题&quot;在数学上是同一族。装箱问题研究的是&quot;把不同尺寸的物品装进若干个容量固定的箱、并尽量少用箱&quot;，该问题在计算上是 NP-hard 的，而判定&quot;能否装进指定数量的箱&quot;是 NP-complete 的；三维装箱在物流中的直接应用就是 cartonization——由软件选择运输箱型与可行的摆放方案（见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bin_packing_problem\">Bin packing problem</a>）。分清&quot;选箱&quot;（上一节）与&quot;摆放&quot;（本节）是同一族问题的两个层次，能避免在设计接口时把两者混在一个函数里。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[待装箱商品] --&gt; B{形状类型}&#10;  B --&gt;|规则立方体| C[正交堆码]&#10;  B --&gt;|圆柱/瓶罐| D[分层 + 交错]&#10;  B --&gt;|可嵌套件| E[锥形/套叠]&#10;  B --&gt;|异形| F[包围盒近似 + 填充]&#10;  C --&gt; G[层数上限校验]&#10;  D --&gt; G&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[承重与堆叠约束]&#10;  H --&gt; I[输出摆放坐标 + 利用率]\">graph TD\n  A[待装箱商品] --&gt; B{形状类型}\n  B --&gt;|规则立方体| C[正交堆码]\n  B --&gt;|圆柱/瓶罐| D[分层 + 交错]\n  B --&gt;|可嵌套件| E[锥形/套叠]\n  B --&gt;|异形| F[包围盒近似 + 填充]\n  C --&gt; G[层数上限校验]\n  D --&gt; G\n  E --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[承重与堆叠约束]\n  H --&gt; I[输出摆放坐标 + 利用率]</pre><h2 id=\"朝向的可行集\">朝向的可行集</h2><h3 id=\"六个正交朝向\">六个正交朝向</h3><p>一个长方体在不考虑倒置禁忌时有 6 个正交朝向（三个轴各两个方向）。但很多商品不能任意朝向：液体必须立放、含电池件有运输朝向要求、带显示面的商品不能面朝下。因此每件商品的<strong>可行朝向集</strong>是业务约束裁剪后的子集，而不是全 6 个。</p>\n<p>在实现上，可行朝向集应当由商品属性派生而不是人工逐 SKU 配置：<code>containsLiquid</code> ⇒ 只有 2 个朝向（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>l</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0197em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 朝上或朝下），<code>uprightAxis</code> 指定 ⇒ 只剩 2 个。这样新增 SKU 时规则自动生效，不需要人工维护映射表。</p>\n<h3 id=\"朝向与承压的耦合\">朝向与承压的耦合</h3><p>朝向不仅影响几何，还影响承压。瓦楞纸箱的承压能力与瓦楞方向相关，商品在箱内是否形成&quot;立柱&quot;也直接影响整箱堆码强度。一个实用规则是：<strong>优先让高刚度面朝下形成承力面，避免让箱内出现悬空段</strong>。悬空段会让上层的载荷集中到某几件商品上，产生局部压溃，而整箱的平均承压可能是达标的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"堆叠与承重\">堆叠与承重</h2><h3 id=\"逐层堆码模型\">逐层堆码模型</h3><p>正交堆码的通用做法是<strong>分层</strong>：先在箱底铺一层，再用该层的顶面作为下一层的底面。每层的排布是一个二维矩形装箱问题（比三维容易得多，可用切片法或简单的行列切分）。层与层之间可以正交旋转（交替层）以提高稳定性，这叫交错堆码。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def stack_layers(items, box, max_layers, layer_load_limit):&#10;    layers, remaining, z = [], list(items), 0&#10;    while remaining and len(layers) &lt; max_layers:&#10;        layer_items = []&#10;        for it in sorted(remaining, key=lambda i: -i.l1 * i.l2):   # 底面积降序&#10;            if try_place_in_layer(it, layer_items, box.inner_l, box.inner_w):&#10;                layer_items.append(it)&#10;        if not layer_items:&#10;            break&#10;        layer_height = max(i.height for i in layer_items)&#10;        if zip_ok(remaining, layer_items) and len(layers) % 2 == 1:&#10;            layer_items = rotate_layer_90(layer_items)             # 交错层&#10;        if z + layer_height &gt; box.inner_h:&#10;            break&#10;        # 承重：当前层之上的累计重量不得超过下层承载&#10;        if total_weight_above(z, box) &gt; layer_load_limit:&#10;            break&#10;        layers.append(layer_items)&#10;        remaining = [i for i in remaining if i not in layer_items]&#10;        z += layer_height&#10;    return layers, remaining\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> stack_layers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(items, box, max_layers, layer_load_limit):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    layers, remaining, z </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">list</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(items), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> remaining </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">and</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(layers) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> max_layers:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        layer_items </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> it </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sorted</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(remaining, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=lambda</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">i.l1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i.l2):   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 底面积降序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> try_place_in_layer(it, layer_items, box.inner_l, box.inner_w):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                layer_items.append(it)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> layer_items:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            break</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        layer_height </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(i.height </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> layer_items)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> zip_ok(remaining, layer_items) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">and</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(layers) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            layer_items </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rotate_layer_90(layer_items)             </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 交错层</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> z </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> layer_height </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> box.inner_h:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            break</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 承重：当前层之上的累计重量不得超过下层承载</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_weight_above(z, box) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> layer_load_limit:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            break</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        layers.append(layer_items)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        remaining </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> remaining </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">not</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> layer_items]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        z </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> layer_height</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> layers, remaining</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个结构里两个约束最容易被漏掉：<code>z + layer_height &gt; box.inner_h</code> 要在放置<strong>之前</strong>判，否则会算出越界方案；<code>limit</code> 类的承重约束要按&quot;其上累计重量&quot;而不是&quot;本层重量&quot;判，因为压坏下层的永远是它上面的全部。</p>\n<h3 id=\"层数与整箱承压\">层数与整箱承压</h3><p>单箱能用几层，与整箱能否被外部堆码是两件事。前者是内装物在箱内的自堆叠，受内装物自身强度限制（易碎品可能只能一层）；后者是整个箱子在托盘/集装箱里被压，受纸箱 BCT 限制（见 <a href=\"../dimension-packaging-masterdata/packaging-material-library-selection\">包材库与选型</a> 对 BCT 与安全系数的讨论）。两者要分别建模，混在一起会得出错误结论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"嵌套与套叠\">嵌套与套叠</h2><h3 id=\"锥形嵌套的几何\">锥形嵌套的几何</h3><p>可嵌套件（塑料桶、花盆、纸杯、部分包装耗材）的堆叠方式与立方体完全不同：它们沿着锥面互相插入，实际占用高度远小于&quot;单件高度 × 件数&quot;。这类商品如果按包围盒堆码，会把利用率严重低估，导致算法选出过大的箱。</p>\n<p>嵌套建模需要额外两个参数：<strong>嵌套节距</strong>（相邻两件插入后高度增量）与<strong>最大嵌套件数</strong>。占用高度近似为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>n</mi><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_{nest}(n) = h_1 + (n-1) \\cdot p, \\qquad n \\le n_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 是节距，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是首件完整高度。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 通常由供应商给出，也可以由两次不同件数的实测高度差反推。这个模型一旦建立，该类商品的选箱会立刻变得更省。</p>\n<h3 id=\"嵌套节距的估算\">嵌套节距的估算</h3><p>节距 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 通常由供应商给出，但在供应商数据缺失时可以用两次实测反推：分别量出 1 件与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 件的堆叠高度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p = (h(n) - h(1))/(n-1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。这个方法有两点要注意：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 要取得足够大以摊薄测量误差，且两次测量的件必须是同一批次同一规格，否则锥度差异会污染结果。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def estimate_nest_pitch(h1_mm, hn_mm, n):&#10;    if n &lt; 2:&#10;        raise ValueError(&quot;need n &gt;= 2 to estimate pitch&quot;)&#10;    p = (hn_mm - h1_mm) / (n - 1)&#10;    if p &lt;= 0:&#10;        # 节距非正说明不是真嵌套（或叠放时被压扁），退回包围盒模型&#10;        return None&#10;    return p&#10;&#10;def nested_height(n, h1_mm, pitch_mm, max_nest):&#10;    effective_n = min(n, max_nest)          # 超过最大嵌套件数后退化为立放&#10;    base = h1_mm + (effective_n - 1) * pitch_mm&#10;    overflow = max(0, n - max_nest)&#10;    return base + overflow * h1_mm\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> estimate_nest_pitch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(h1_mm, hn_mm, n):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        raise</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ValueError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"need n >= 2 to estimate pitch\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (hn_mm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> h1_mm) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 节距非正说明不是真嵌套（或叠放时被压扁），退回包围盒模型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> nested_height</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n, h1_mm, pitch_mm, max_nest):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    effective_n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n, max_nest)          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 超过最大嵌套件数后退化为立放</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    base </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> h1_mm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (effective_n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pitch_mm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    overflow </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> max_nest)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> overflow </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> h1_mm</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>max_nest</code> 这个上限是必要的：锥形件的嵌套深度受自身结构限制，插到一定件数后就插不动了，再往上必须重新起一摞。漏掉它会导致高估嵌套收益，算法选出一个几何上放不下全部商品的箱。</p>\n<h3 id=\"异形件的处理\">异形件的处理</h3><p>严格异形（不规则曲面、软性可压缩件）没有通用解法。实务上用<strong>保守包围盒 + 允许压缩率</strong>的近似：给包围盒一个可压缩系数（软性件可压 10–20%），并在验证环节用抽检确认压缩不会导致破损。这个近似必然会误判，所以必须配套监控——如果某类商品的破损率异常，先怀疑压缩近似的乐观偏差。</p>\n<h2 id=\"利用率与浪费分析\">利用率与浪费分析</h2><h3 id=\"浪费的三类来源\">浪费的三类来源</h3><p>体积利用率的缺口可以分解成三类可分别优化的浪费：<strong>几何浪费</strong>（形状不匹配导致的空隙）、<strong>约束浪费</strong>（因为承重、朝向、隔离约束而不能放的体积）、<strong>操作浪费</strong>（因为操作不便而人为留白，如留出提手位）。分开度量这三者非常有用：如果几何浪费很小但约束浪费很大，说明问题在商品组合或箱型档位设计，而不在摆放算法。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>浪费类型</th>\n<th>观察方式</th>\n<th>典型成因</th>\n<th>改进归属</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>几何浪费</td>\n<td>摆放完成后的空隙体积</td>\n<td>形状不匹配、档位跨度过大</td>\n<td>选箱算法 / 箱型档位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>约束浪费</td>\n<td>被禁用体积（朝向、承重、隔离占位）</td>\n<td>加固规范过严、属性标注过粗</td>\n<td>规范与商品标注</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>操作浪费</td>\n<td>人工预留的空位</td>\n<td>提手位、易取件、工位习惯</td>\n<td>工位设计与培训</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三类浪费的分母都是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{usable}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ab</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，因此三者之和加上净占用正好等于 1，可以互相校验。如果三者加起来明显小于 1，说明有一类没被统计到——通常是操作浪费，因为它最难被系统观测到。</p>\n<h3 id=\"与选箱的联动\">与选箱的联动</h3><p>利用率不是终点而是输入。选箱算法读完摆放结果后，应当反过来评估&quot;换一个箱型是否利用率更高&quot;——因为有些箱型虽然几何上能装，但装完浪费巨大，体积重反而更贵。这个反馈回路是 cartonization 从&quot;能装&quot;进化到&quot;会选&quot;的关键。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>朝向、堆叠、嵌套三个自由度共同决定利用率；可行朝向集应由商品属性派生而非人工配置。</li>\n<li>利用率必须用净可用容积做分母，用外径会把纸板厚度错算成浪费。</li>\n<li>正交堆码走分层模型，层内是二维装箱；承重约束按&quot;其上累计重量&quot;判定。</li>\n<li>内装物自堆叠与整箱外部堆码是两件事，分别受商品强度和纸箱 BCT 限制。</li>\n<li>可嵌套件用节距模型能显著提升利用率，异形件用可压缩包围盒近似并配套破损监控。</li>\n<li>浪费分几何、约束、操作三类，分开度量才能定位该改算法还是该改箱型档位。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸\">延伸</h2><p>摆放结果如何影响计费重，见 <a href=\"dimensional-weight-freight-link\">计费重 DIM 与运费成本联动</a>；装入箱之后如何继续码到托盘，见 <a href=\"../pallet-container-loading/pallet-pattern-unitization-wrapping\">托盘堆码/缠绕/规格与单元化</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"堆码/朝向/嵌套与体积利用率","id":"堆码-朝向-嵌套与体积利用率"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"朝向的可行集","id":"朝向的可行集"},{"level":3,"text":"六个正交朝向","id":"六个正交朝向"},{"level":3,"text":"朝向与承压的耦合","id":"朝向与承压的耦合"},{"level":2,"text":"堆叠与承重","id":"堆叠与承重"},{"level":3,"text":"逐层堆码模型","id":"逐层堆码模型"},{"level":3,"text":"层数与整箱承压","id":"层数与整箱承压"},{"level":2,"text":"嵌套与套叠","id":"嵌套与套叠"},{"level":3,"text":"锥形嵌套的几何","id":"锥形嵌套的几何"},{"level":3,"text":"嵌套节距的估算","id":"嵌套节距的估算"},{"level":3,"text":"异形件的处理","id":"异形件的处理"},{"level":2,"text":"利用率与浪费分析","id":"利用率与浪费分析"},{"level":3,"text":"浪费的三类来源","id":"浪费的三类来源"},{"level":3,"text":"与选箱的联动","id":"与选箱的联动"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸","id":"延伸"}],"prev":{"title":"单件/多件最优箱选择算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/packaging-loading-optimization/cartonization-algorithm/optimal-carton-selection-algorithm"},"next":{"title":"计费重 DIM 与运费成本联动（联067）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/packaging-loading-optimization/cartonization-algorithm/dimensional-weight-freight-link"}}